```

Purpose:

```text
document_types.yaml      → document classification rules/signals
entity_schema.yaml       → mandatory/optional entities and extraction schema
validation_rules.yaml    → business and quality validation rules
hitl_policy.yaml         → review thresholds, timeout, escalation policy
letter_templates.yaml    → approval/rejection/exception prompt templates
tenants/*.yaml           → provider enablement, feature flags, overrides
```

Provider/tenant config should override defaults.

Example:

```yaml
provider_id: max_bupa
enabled: false

features:
  pdf_ingestion: false
  auto_processing: false
  hitl_review: false
```

