**LLM Provider Design**

Required modules:

```text
app/llm/
  base.py
  openai_client.py
  anthropic_client.py
  provider_factory.py
  schemas.py
```

Common interface:

```python
class LLMClient(Protocol):
    def classify_document(...): ...
    def extract_entities(...): ...
    def draft_letter(...): ...
    def draft_exception_summary(...): ...
```

Provider selected by config:

```yaml
llm:
  provider: openai
  model: gpt-4.1-mini
```

or:

```yaml
llm:
  provider: anthropic
  model: claude-sonnet-4-5
```

The workflow must not directly call OpenAI or Anthropic SDKs. It should call `LLMClient`.

